From 971c3afee3415528e3d2728381bcb0f6da21a9d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CosmosEx Buildroot <4372835+planeturban@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:44:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ce_main_app: image library: unpack cache, RAM downloads,
 IMAGE_STORAGE

Floppy library stage 6.2, second part (cosmosex-floppy-library.md,
items 4 and 5):

- Zipped images are unpacked on insert into a RAM disk cache
  (UNPACK_CACHE_DIR, /run/ce-floppy, a 16 MB tmpfs on the Buildroot
  image): one folder per zip (path, size and time), reused when the same
  zip is inserted again; the unpacked size is read from the zip's
  central directory first and the least recently inserted folders are
  evicted to make room, never one an inserted image comes from; a full
  RAM disk or a bad zip fails the insert with a reason, half unpacks are
  removed (also at start). Fixes the /tmp/zipedfloppy bug: that folder
  was emptied on every zip insert, so the saves of a zipped disk were
  lost when another zip was inserted. unzip runs without a shell (file
  names with quotes broke the old command).
- Floppy image downloads go to RAM (/tmp/ce-download) and are unzipped
  there, then copied to the storage as <name>.tmp, synced and renamed
  (no more 'mv' through the shell).
- IMAGE_STORAGE: auto (first USB drive, else the shared drive, as
  before, else /pi/img_download, else RAM), shared (the shared drive even
  with a USB stick), or share:/usb:/local: folders. When the place isn't
  available, downloads go to RAM (/tmp/floppy_images) instead of
  failing. GET/PUT /api/v1/settings/floppy "imageStorage"; the library
  search answer says where downloads go ("downloads").
- local:<path>: a folder on the CosmosEx's own storage (/pi), for
  IMAGELIB_SOURCES and IMAGE_STORAGE.
- A share: / usb: / local: source that goes away keeps its images in
  the list, flagged unavailable ("available": false in search results,
  shown greyed out), after all usable images, so the same image from
  another source wins; they aren't offered on the Atari or downloaded.
